      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Starts on the first matching day on or after the selected date. Each occurrence can be completed independently and stays on its scheduled day. Edits apply to every occurrence of this repeating item, including earlier days. Completion is separate for each day. Choosing Never keeps only this occurrence.",
